**Reused Evidence**
- `E0051` supports the appointments/coordination side of 8B. REUSE_JSON: {"evidence_ids":["E0051"],"lenses":["8B.4","8B.5"]}
- `E0052` supports the fiscal-framework and operationalization side of 8B. REUSE_JSON: {"evidence_ids":["E0052"],"lenses":["8B.2","8B.6","8B.10"]}
- `E0053` supports the administration’s stated blueprint and macro priorities. REUSE_JSON: {"evidence_ids":["E0053"],"lenses":["8B.1","8B.2","8B.7","8B.9","8B.10"]}
- `E0054` is inherited macro context for price stability. REUSE_JSON: {"evidence_ids":["E0054"],"lenses":["8B.7","8B.9"]}
- `E0055` supports the inflation-response and crisis-management side. REUSE_JSON: {"evidence_ids":["E0055"],"lenses":["8B.8","8B.9","8B.10"]}
